# Card.attachToEntity fires Mode$ Attached for a player host too (an "Enchant
# player" Aura), with the player as the triggering target. Siona's ValidTarget$
# Creature.YouCtrl is a card spec, so the player never matches and no token is
# created.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 R
tapformana human 3 R
tapformana human 4 R
tapformana human 5 R
tapformana human 6 R
queue targets ai
queue paygeneric R
queue paygeneric R
queue paygeneric R
castspell human 1
resolvestack
